Output demo.gif
Set Shell bash
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1500
Set Height 420
Set Padding 24
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 35ms

Hide
Type `eval "$(bash /work/setup.sh)" && cd "$DEMO_REPO" && export PS1='$ ' && clear` Enter
Sleep 1s
Show

Type "# Claude Code was asked to add rate limiting. It stopped. What else did it change?" Enter
Sleep 800ms
Type "unasked" Enter
Sleep 7s
Type "clear" Enter
Type "# Drop the hunk nobody asked for; everything else stays as the agent left it" Enter
Sleep 800ms
Type "unasked --drop h01" Enter
Sleep 2s
Type "unasked" Enter
Sleep 4s
Type "# Changed your mind? Put it back exactly" Enter
Sleep 800ms
Type "unasked undo" Enter
Sleep 3s
